ed","id":"act_fa51e0b32a3ef918","kind":"detected","kindLabel":"Actions détectées","label":"Soin","mechanicId":"action-heal","metrics":[],"modes":[],"sides":[],"sourceType":"heal","target":null,"trigger":null}],"baseType":"passive","characterId":"SheHulk","energy":null,"iconUrl":"https://assets.marvelstrikeforce.com/imgs/ICON_ABILITY_SHEHULK_PASSIVE_702edf20.png","id":"abl_a43357a093c27056","isEmpowered":false,"maxLevel":"5","mechanicsStatus":"available","mentions":[{"abilityId":"abl_a43357a093c27056","abilityType":"passive","chance":null,"characterId":"SheHulk","conditions":[],"evidence":"official_text_only","excerpt":"En défense de guerre, si ce personnage a 4 alliés Retcon :","id":"txt_7de76d3fc14d277e","kind":"mention","kindLabel":"Mentions","mechanicId":"war-defense","metrics":[],"modes":[],"sides":[],"target":null,"term":"défense de guerre","trigger":null},{"abilityId":"abl_a43357a093c27056","abilityType":"passive","chance":null,"characterId":"SheHulk","conditions":[],"evidence":"official_text_only","excerpt":"Ce personnage et tous les alliés ne peuvent pas obtenir Traumatisme.","id":"txt_d41bca121988a9cb","kind":"mention","kindLabel":"Mentions","mechanicId":"trauma","metrics":[],"modes":[],"sides":[],"target":null,"term":"Traumatisme","trigger":null},{"abilityId":"abl_a43357a093c27056","abilityType":"passive","chance":null,"characterId":"SheHulk","conditions":[],"evidence":"official_text_only","excerpt":"Au gain de Furtivité, obtient Provocation et rend 30 % de la vie max. de ce personnage.","id":"txt_d986741256b73254","kind":"mention","kindLabel":"Mentions","mechanicId":"stealth","metrics":[],"modes":[],"sides":[],"target":null,"term":"Furtivité","trigger":null}],"name":"Sentence","officialText":"À l’apparition, donne Provocation.\n\nÀ chaque tour, rend 15 % de la vie max de ce personnage.\n\nAu gain de Furtivité, obtient Provocation et rend 30 % de la vie max. de ce personnage.\n\nLorsqu'un ennemi attaque ce personnage, un allié Retcon, un allié Gamma, ou un allié Quatre Fantastiques, obtient +1 fois Chargé, jusqu'à un maximum de 5.\nSi Jeff le requin terrestre est un allié, obtient +2 fois Chargé à la place.\n\nAu maximum de Chargé :\n> Transfère tous les effets nuisibles de soi et de tous les alliés à l’ennemi ayant le plus de dégâts. En guerre, donne +500 % de focalisation pour cette attaque.\n> Attaque l'ennemi ayant les dégâts les plus élevés et inflige 300 % de dégâts. Attaque toutes les cibles adjacentes et inflige 250 % de dégâts.\n> Perd tous les Chargé.\n\nEn défense de guerre, si ce personnage a 4 alliés Retcon :\n> À l'apparition, donne +1 fois Chargé jusqu'à un maximum de 5 fois.\n> Ce personnage et tous les alliés ne peuvent pas obtenir Traumatisme.\n> Les ennemis ne peuvent pas faire d’appui.","operations":[{"abilityId":"abl_a43357a093c27056","abilityType":"passive","actionOrder":0,"chance":null,"characterId":"SheHulk","conditions":[],"effect":{"label":"Provocation","mechanicId":"taunt","resolved":true,"sourceName":"Taunt"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_4ed62721b9ad3734","kind":"effect_apply","kindLabel":"Applique","mechanicIds":["taunt"],"metrics":[{"key":"useCount","label":"Quantité indiquée","unit":null,"value":1}],"modes":[],"scope":"Cible de l’action","sides":[],"sourceType":"proc","target":null,"trigger":"À l’entrée dans un état"},{"abilityId":"abl_a43357a093c27056","abilityType":"passive","actionOrder":1,"chance":null,"characterId":"SheHulk","conditions":[],"effect":{"label":"Provocation","mechanicId":"taunt","resolved":true,"sourceName":"Taunt"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_52478be26c27a88c","kind":"effect_apply","kindLabel":"Applique","mechanicIds":["taunt"],"metrics":[{"key":"useCount","label":"Quantité indiquée","unit":null,"value":1}],"modes":[],"scope":"Cible de l’action","sides":[],"sourceType":"proc","target":"allié","trigger":"Au début du combat"},{"abilityId":"abl_a43357a093c27056","abilityType":"passive","actionOrder":2,"chance":null,"characterId":"SheHulk","conditions":["Conditi